# KivaPlus API Complete Flow Documentation
## From Registration to Condominium Access with Detailed Permission Analysis

### **🔍 Route Configuration Validation**

**✅ VALIDATION RESULT**: The `internal/shared/routes/default.go` file **DOES NOT EXIST** and is **NOT NECESSARY**.

**Current Architecture**:
- ✅ `configs/routes.json` - Central route configuration with permissions
- ✅ Route handlers in respective modules (auth, users, condominiums)
- ✅ Permission system via `internal/shared/permissions/`
- ❌ `internal/shared/routes/default.go` - **NOT FOUND** (can be safely ignored)

**Conclusion**: The system correctly uses JSON-based configuration without redundant Go files.

---

## 🔄 **COMPLETE API FLOW FLOWCHART**

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([🚀 User Journey Starts]) --> Register[📝 POST /register]

    %% Registration Flow
    Register --> RegValidation{Request Valid?}
    RegValidation -->|❌ No| RegError[❌ 400: Validation Error]
    RegValidation -->|✅ Yes| RegProcess[🔄 Create User Account]
    RegProcess --> RegSuccess[✅ 201: User Created<br/>🎯 Role: sindico (ID: 3)<br/>📊 Profile: incomplete]

    %% Login Flow
    RegSuccess --> Login[🔐 POST /login]
    Login --> LoginValidation{Credentials Valid?}
    LoginValidation -->|❌ No| LoginError[❌ 401: Invalid Credentials]
    LoginValidation -->|✅ Yes| LoginProcess[🔄 Generate JWT Tokens]
    LoginProcess --> LoginSuccess[✅ 200: JWT Tokens<br/>🎫 Access Token (1h)<br/>🎫 Refresh Token (30d)]

    %% Profile Check
    LoginSuccess --> ProfileCheck{Profile Complete?}
    ProfileCheck -->|❌ No| ProfileIncomplete[⚠️ Profile Incomplete<br/>🔒 Limited Access]
    ProfileCheck -->|✅ Yes| FullAccess[✅ Full API Access]

    %% Profile Completion Flow
    ProfileIncomplete --> GetProfile[👤 GET /profile]
    GetProfile --> ProfileData[📋 Show Profile Data<br/>🔍 Status: incomplete]
    ProfileData --> CompleteProfile[👤 PUT /profile]
    CompleteProfile --> ProfileValidation{Profile Data Valid?}
    ProfileValidation -->|❌ No| ProfileError[❌ 422: Validation Error]
    ProfileValidation -->|✅ Yes| ProfileUpdate[🔄 Update Profile + New JWT]
    ProfileUpdate --> ProfileSuccess[✅ 200: Profile Complete<br/>🎫 New JWT Tokens<br/>📊 Status: complete]

    %% Full Access Routes
    ProfileSuccess --> FullAccess
    FullAccess --> CreateCondo[🏢 POST /condominios]
    CreateCondo --> CondoValidation{Has Permission?}
    CondoValidation -->|❌ No| CondoError[❌ 403: Forbidden]
    CondoValidation -->|✅ Yes| CondoProcess[🔄 Create Condominium<br/>🎯 Assign Sindico Role]
    CondoProcess --> CondoSuccess[✅ 201: Condominium Created<br/>🎫 New JWT with Sindico Role<br/>🏢 User becomes Sindico]

    %% List and Access Condominiums
    CondoSuccess --> ListCondos[📋 GET /condominios]
    ListCondos --> CondoList[📊 List User's Condominiums<br/>🔍 Filtered by User Roles]
    CondoList --> GetCondo[🏢 GET /condominios/{id}]
    GetCondo --> CondoAccessCheck{Has Condominium Access?}
    CondoAccessCheck -->|❌ No| CondoAccessError[❌ 403: No Access to Condominium]
    CondoAccessCheck -->|✅ Yes| CondoDetails[✅ 200: Condominium Details<br/>📊 Full Condominium Data<br/>🔑 User Permissions in Context]

    %% Error Recovery Flows
    RegError --> Register
    LoginError --> Login
    ProfileError --> CompleteProfile
    CondoError --> End([❌ Access Denied])
    CondoAccessError --> End
    CondoDetails --> End([✅ Complete Flow])

    %% Refresh Token Flow (Parallel)
    LoginSuccess --> RefreshFlow[🔄 POST /token/refresh]
    RefreshFlow --> RefreshValidation{Refresh Token Valid?}
    RefreshValidation -->|❌ No| RefreshError[❌ 401: Invalid Refresh Token]
    RefreshValidation -->|✅ Yes| RefreshSuccess[✅ 200: New Access Token<br/>🎫 Updated JWT<br/>🔄 Fresh Permissions]
    RefreshError --> Login
    RefreshSuccess --> FullAccess
```

---

## 📋 **DETAILED API ENDPOINTS WITH PERMISSION ANALYSIS**

### **1. 📝 POST /register**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🟢 **PUBLIC** (No authentication required)
- **Role Requirements**: None
- **Permission Check**: None
- **Why Enabled**: Registration must be accessible to anonymous users
- **Security**: Rate limiting and validation only

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "MinhaSenh@123!",
  "confirm_password": "MinhaSenh@123!",
  "marital_status": "solteiro"
}
```

**Response (201 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "User created successfully",
  "data": {
    "user_id": 1,
    "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
    "profile_status": "incomplete"
  }
}
```

**🎯 Role Assignment**: User automatically gets `sindico` role (ID: 3)

---

### **2. 🔐 POST /login**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🟢 **PUBLIC** (No authentication required)
- **Role Requirements**: None
- **Permission Check**: Credential validation only
- **Why Enabled**: Authentication endpoint must be public
- **Security**: Credential validation, account status check

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "MinhaSenh@123!"
}
```

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "id": 1,
      "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
      "active": true
    },
    "tokens": {
      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "expires_in": 3600
    }
  }
}
```

**🎫 JWT Claims Generated:**
- `user_id`: User identifier
- `email`: User email
- `token_type`: "access"
- `profile_status`: "incomplete" or "complete"
- `token_version`: For cache invalidation

---

### **3. 🔄 POST /token/refresh**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🟡 **SEMI-PROTECTED** (Requires valid refresh token)
- **Role Requirements**: None (token-based)
- **Permission Check**: Refresh token validation
- **Why Enabled**: Token refresh must work with refresh tokens only
- **Security**: Refresh token validation, user status check

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs..."
}
```

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Token refreshed successfully",
  "data": {
    "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
    "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
    "expires_in": 3600
  }
}
```

**🔄 Permission Refresh**: New tokens reflect current user roles and profile status

---

### **4. 👤 GET /profile**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🔴 **PROTECTED** (Requires JWT authentication)
- **Role Requirements**: Any authenticated role (1,2,3,4,5)
- **Permission Check**: `profile:read:own`
- **Why Enabled**: Any authenticated user can view their own profile
- **Security**: JWT validation, user can only access own profile

**Request**: No payload (JWT in Authorization header)

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Profile retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "id": 1,
      "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
      "profile_status": "complete"
    },
    "profile": {
      "name": "João Silva Santos",
      "phone": "+5511999999999",
      "document_type": "CPF",
      "document": "12345678901",
      "birth_date": "1990-05-15"
    },
    "address": {
      "street": "Rua das Flores, 123",
      "neighborhood": "Centro",
      "city": "São Paulo",
      "state": "SP",
      "zip_code": "01234-567"
    },
    "roles": [
      {
        "id": 3,
        "name": "sindico",
        "condominium_id": null,
        "condominium_name": null
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

---

### **5. 👤 PUT /profile**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🔴 **PROTECTED** (Requires JWT authentication)
- **Role Requirements**: Any authenticated role (1,2,3,4,5)
- **Permission Check**: `profile:update:own`
- **Why Enabled**: Any authenticated user can update their own profile
- **Security**: JWT validation, profile completion validation, new JWT issued

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "name": "João Silva Santos",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "phone": "+5511999999999",
  "document_type": "CPF",
  "document": "12345678901",
  "birth_date": "1990-05-15",
  "address": {
    "street": "Rua das Flores, 123",
    "neighborhood": "Centro",
    "city": "São Paulo",
    "state": "SP",
    "zip_code": "01234-567"
  }
}
```

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Profile completed successfully",
  "data": {
    "profile": {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "João Silva Santos",
      "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
      "phone": "+5511999999999",
      "document_type": "CPF",
      "document": "12345678901",
      "profile_status": "complete"
    },
    "tokens": {
      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs..."
    }
  }
}
```

**🎫 Token Update**: New JWT issued with `profile_status: "complete"`

---

### **6. 🏢 POST /condominios**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🔴 **PROTECTED** (Requires JWT + Complete Profile)
- **Role Requirements**: Any role with complete profile (1,2,3,4,5)
- **Permission Check**: `condominios:create:global` + Complete Profile Required
- **Why Enabled**: Users with complete profiles can create condominiums
- **Security**: JWT validation, profile completion check, sindico role assignment
- **Special**: User cannot already be sindico of another condominium

**Request Payload:**
```json
{
  "name": "Residencial Jardim das Flores",
  "cnpj": "12345678000199",
  "address": {
    "street": "Av. Principal, 1000",
    "neighborhood": "Jardim das Flores",
    "city": "São Paulo",
    "state": "SP",
    "zip_code": "04567-890"
  },
  "total_units": 120,
  "admin_fee_percentage": 0.05
}
```

**Response (201 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Condominium created successfully",
  "data": {
    "condominium": {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Residencial Jardim das Flores",
      "cnpj": "12345678000199",
      "total_units": 120,
      "admin_fee_percentage": 0.05,
      "status": "active",
      "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
    },
    "tokens": {
      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
      "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs..."
    }
  }
}
```

**🎯 Role Assignment**:
- Removes general `sindico` role (ID: 3) without condominium
- Adds `sindico` role (ID: 3) for the specific condominium
- Adds `admin` role (ID: 2) for the specific condominium
**🎫 Token Update**: New JWT issued with updated roles

---

### **7. 📋 GET /condominios**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🔴 **PROTECTED** (Requires JWT authentication)
- **Role Requirements**: Any authenticated role (1,2,3,4,5)
- **Permission Check**: `condominios:list:global`
- **Why Enabled**: Any authenticated user can list condominiums they have access to
- **Security**: JWT validation, results filtered by user roles
- **Filtering Logic**:
  - `super_admin` (1): Sees all condominiums
  - `admin` (2): Sees condominiums based on their permissions
  - `sindico` (3): Sees condominiums they manage
  - `morador` (4): Sees condominiums they belong to
  - Others: Sees condominiums based on their roles

**Request**: No payload (JWT in Authorization header)

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Condominiums retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "condominiums": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Residencial Jardim das Flores",
        "cnpj": "12345678000199",
        "total_units": 120,
        "user_role": "sindico",
        "status": "active"
      }
    ],
    "total": 1
  }
}
```

---

### **8. 🏢 GET /condominios/{id}**

**🔒 PERMISSION ANALYSIS:**
- **Access Level**: 🔴 **PROTECTED** (Requires JWT + Condominium Access)
- **Role Requirements**: Must have role in the specific condominium OR be super_admin
- **Permission Check**: `condominios:read:condominium` + Condominium Access Validation
- **Why Enabled/Disabled**:
  - ✅ **ENABLED** if: User has role in condominium OR is super_admin
  - ❌ **DISABLED** if: User has no role in the requested condominium
- **Security**: JWT validation, condominium-specific access control
- **Access Logic**:
  - `super_admin` (1): Can access any condominium
  - `admin` (2): Can access condominiums based on their permissions
  - `sindico` (3): Can access condominiums they manage
  - `morador` (4): Can access condominiums they belong to
  - Others: Based on their specific roles in the condominium

**Request**: No payload (JWT in Authorization header, condominium ID in URL)

**Response (200 Success):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Condominium retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "condominium": {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Residencial Jardim das Flores",
      "cnpj": "12345678000199",
      "address": {
        "street": "Av. Principal, 1000",
        "neighborhood": "Jardim das Flores",
        "city": "São Paulo",
        "state": "SP",
        "zip_code": "04567-890"
      },
      "total_units": 120,
      "admin_fee_percentage": 0.05,
      "status": "active",
      "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
    },
    "user_role": "sindico",
    "permissions": {
      "condominiums": {"read": true, "update": true},
      "units": {"create": true, "read": true, "update": true, "delete": true},
      "residents": {"create": true, "read": true, "update": true, "delete": true},
      "employees": {"create": true, "read": true, "update": true, "delete": true},
      "vehicles": {"create": true, "read": true, "update": true, "delete": true},
      "contracts": {"create": true, "read": true, "update": true, "delete": true},
      "companies": {"read": true},
      "services": {"read": true}
    }
  }
}
```

**Response (403 Forbidden - No Access):**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Insufficient permissions",
  "error": {
    "code": "INSUFFICIENT_PERMISSIONS",
    "details": "condominium access required"
  }
}
```

